# UI

Paper, ink, select. Light is the default document; dark follows `prefers-color-scheme`. `--select` is only used as a highlight — never as glow, grid, or gradient chrome.

Hover/focus/active paint a hard rectangle, zero radius. Instrument Sans for UI. Martian Mono for paste content. TTL hairline. ⌘K.

The signed-out home is a sentence with *Copy* marked, not a hero + card + shimmer stack.

Never Inter. No emoji chrome. Do not imply the server reads plaintext.
